  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SINOPLAST capacity building for reducing plastic&amp;microplastic pollution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to build capacity to improve China&#x2019;s plastic waste management, reduce marine litter and microplastic pollution. The project is implemented by Chinese Ministry of Ecology and Environment through Basel Convention Regional Center for Asia and Pacific in China. Norwegian Institute of Water Research (NIVA) and National Environment Agency (NEA) will provide technical support</narrative>
  </description>
